---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const projects=[
['Corporate Communications & Media Relations','A financial-services organisation requires consistent and timely bilingual communications across multiple external channels.','Support and manage press releases, media engagement, corporate website content, social media and corporate publications.','Coordinate content, interviews, media lists, monitoring and external information updates across communications channels.','Strengthened consistency and timeliness of corporate communications across media and digital touchpoints.'],
['Listed-company Financial PR & IR','Listed companies require clear market messaging and professionally managed engagement with media and stakeholders.','Supported approximately 15 listed-company clients with financial PR and IR solutions.','Prepared press materials, supported media pitching and interviews, and helped execute product launches, press conferences, gala dinners and networking events.','Helped clients reinforce key corporate messages and broaden stakeholder engagement.'],
['ESG & Stakeholder Engagement','Corporate and infrastructure environments require structured engagement with external stakeholders and the public.','Planned and supported ESG activities, public communications and stakeholder-facing materials.','Coordinated event materials, venues, consultation documents, presentations and engagement touchpoints.','Supported clearer stakeholder communications and delivery of ESG-related initiatives.'],
['Issues & Crisis Communications','Public-facing organisations need timely responses to enquiries, complaints and emerging public-opinion issues.','Supported monitoring, enquiry handling and crisis-communication preparation.','Tracked media and public sentiment, responded to public enquiries and complaints, and prepared crisis-management strategies.','Improved readiness for stakeholder-sensitive issues and reputation-management needs.']
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Selected Work | Siqi Chen"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Selected Work</div><h1>Representative Experience</h1><p>Public-safe examples drawn from in-house, agency-side and stakeholder-facing communications work.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container">{projects.map((p,i)=><article class="card" style="margin-bottom:24px"><div class="number">0{i+1}</div><h2 style="font-size:30px">{p[0]}</h2><div class="grid-4"><div><div class="kicker">Context</div><p>{p[1]}</p></div><div><div class="kicker">My Role</div><p>{p[2]}</p></div><div><div class="kicker">Approach</div><p>{p[3]}</p></div><div><div class="kicker">Contribution</div><p>{p[4]}</p></div></div></article>)}</div></section><section class="section alt"><div class="container"><div class="notice"><strong>Portfolio note:</strong> Examples are presented at a high level and avoid publishing confidential client materials, internal documents, non-public information or sensitive metrics.</div></div></section></BaseLayout>
